OL,3,GNEWSAWoman whose 'real-life ghost      
OL,4,Astory' inspired TV series reveals      
OL,5,Ascariest encounter                     
OL,7,FThe woman at the centre of a "real-life
OL,8,Fghost story" that inspired a new TV    
OL,9,Fdrama says the scariest thing she saw  
OL,10,Fwas an "old lady" looking at her from  
OL,11,Fher house.                             
OL,13,FLiz Rich moved from London to Bannau   
OL,14,FBrycheiniog, also known as Brecon      
OL,15,FBeacons, with her husband while        
OL,16,Fpregnant in 1989 to a farmhouse now    
OL,17,Fdubbed one of Britain's most haunted   
OL,18,Fhouses.                                
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
