OL,3,GNEWSAWoman whose 'real-life ghost      
OL,4,Astory' inspired TV series reveals      
OL,5,Ascariest encounter                     
OL,7,FWithin seven years Rich said their     
OL,8,F"idyllic, fairytale" home turned to    
OL,9,Fhearing unexplained footsteps, seeing  
OL,10,Fanimals mysteriously die, apparitions -
OL,11,Fand an "old lady" who watched her from 
OL,12,Fthe house as she walked up the         
OL,13,Fdriveway.                              
OL,15,FDanny Robins, writer and creator of The
OL,16,FWitch Farm, said: "It's one of the     
OL,17,Fgreatest ghost stories I've ever come  
OL,18,Facross."                               
